## Interface: 20506
## Title: ArenaChillPrep
## Notes: Auto-trades crafted items (e.g. healthstones) to your partner during arena preparation on TBC Anniversary.
## Author: ArenaChillPrep
## Version: 0.1.0
## License: MIT
## SavedVariables: ArenaChillPrepDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ArenaChillPrepCharDB
## DefaultState: enabled
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ArenaChillPrep\Textures\icon.tga

# Load order matters: no libraries, so bootstrap first, then Data/Utils, then Classes.
# Every file receives the shared ACP table through the `...` vararg chain
# (each module file must end with `return ACP;`).

bootstrap.lua

Data/Constants.lua
Data/Items.lua
Data/DefaultSettings.lua
Data/Localization.lua
Data/Workflows.lua

Utils/Tables.lua
Utils/Items.lua
Utils/Timers.lua

Classes/Events.lua
Classes/Settings.lua
Classes/SettingsMigrator.lua
Classes/WorkflowRepository.lua
Classes/WorkflowKeybindController.lua
Classes/TradePlanner.lua
Classes/StateMachine.lua
Classes/Preconditions.lua
Classes/SpellbookCatalogBuilder.lua
Classes/WarlockCatalogExtender.lua
Classes/SpellbookLabels.lua
Classes/WorkflowSpellbook.lua
Classes/ArenaPrep.lua
Classes/Inventory.lua
Classes/DeliveryController.lua
Classes/TradeManager.lua
Classes/WorkflowEngine.lua
Classes/WorkflowCastController.lua
Classes/PetAbilityCaster.lua
Classes/WorkflowItemSteps.lua
Classes/WorkflowBindings.lua
Classes/UI/Widgets.lua
Classes/UI/WorkflowUI.lua
Classes/OptionsUI.lua

# Bindings.xml (Key Bindings entries) is NOT listed here: on 20506 the client
# auto-loads a file named Bindings.xml from the addon folder. Listing it in the
# TOC makes the client parse it a second time with the UI XML parser, producing
# "Unrecognized XML: Binding" errors per entry (verified 2026-08-19). It is
# shipped to the client by deploy.ps1 / -Bundle as part of the game artifacts.

# Unit tests run OUTSIDE the game (LuaJIT) — see Tests/run-tests.ps1.
# Nothing in Tests/ is loaded by the game.
